{% if passages | length == 0 %}
The grounding of the {{ tier.difficulty }} tier of "{{ tier.title }}" names no ingested section. Report this to the tadpole: cards can't be written without grounding.
{% else %}
The grounding of the {{ tier.difficulty }} tier of "{{ tier.title }}": {{ passages | length }} passages. Cite them by number.
{% for passage in passages %}

<passage number="{{ passage.number }}" source="{{ passage.path }}{% if passage.heading %}#{{ passage.heading }}{% endif %}">
{{ passage.text }}
</passage>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
